          "type": "LinguisticObject",
          "content": "French: female monologue performer. Cha's textual shaman who empties self to channel 9 Muses: 'She allows others. In place of her. Admits others to make full.' (p.3). Not fluent speaker but medium of fragments: 'noise, groan, bits torn from words.' Takes on punctuation as bodily condition: 'She would become, herself, demarcations.' (p.4). Structural frame for entire work. NOTE: Treated as distinct entity from Cha — conflation refused at data level.",
          "classified_as": "description"
        }
      ],
