      "dictv:entityType": "Concept",
      "referred_to_by": [
        {
          "type": "LinguisticObject",
          "content": "Authorial strategy of emptying self to channel absent voices — triadic structure: DISEUSE → Muses → Female Figures. 'She allows others. In place of her. Admits others to make full.' (p.3). Modeled on Korean mudang's 접신(接神) structure. NOTE: Modeling type — this is the researcher's interpretive frame, not a term in Dictée's text. Epistemological status must be explicitly argued in paper Section 5.",
          "classified_as": "description"
        }
      ],
