      "@id": "dict:concept/cyclical-time",
      "@type": "Type",
      "identified_by": [
        {
          "type": "Name",
          "content": "Cyclical time",
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "type": "Name",
          "content": "순환적 시간",
          "language": "ko"
        }
      ],
      "dictv:entityType": "Concept",
      "referred_to_by": [
        {
          "type": "LinguisticObject",
          "content": "'Dead time. Hollow depression interred... resistant to memory. Waits.' (p.123). Time buried underground, requiring excavation by diseuse's invocation. Connected to Persephone in underworld. 'Until.' — permanent incompletion. Theoretical basis: Lugones (2010) [primary]; Kusch (tr.2010, orig.1978) via Lugones — Andean context, NOT directly applied to Korean text.",
          "classified_as": "description"
        }
      ],
